==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nn|halde}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|nn|non|halda}}, from {{der|nn|gem-pro|*haldaną}}. Akin to {{cog|en|hold}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/²hɑldɑ/|lang=no}}

===Verb===
{{nn-verb|held|heldt|halde|imp2=haldt}}

# to {{l|en|hold}}
#: ''Kva '''held''' du på? ''
#:: What are you '''holding'''?
'''halda fram'''
# to {{l|en|continue}}
'''halda seg'''
# to {{l|en|endure}}, {{l|en|keep}}
#: ''Kor lenge '''held''' denne mjølka '''seg'''?''
#:: How long will this milk '''keep'''?
#: {{usex|nn|Eg må på do. Eg klarer ikkje å '''halda meg''' lenger.|I need the toilet. I can not '''keep''' it in any longer.}}

